WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.468
It is imperative, imperative to
do what Tim was talking about,

2
00:00:05.468 --> 00:00:08.999
which is map out, who,
in what seat, what competencies,

3
00:00:08.999 --> 00:00:13.946
either technically and behaviorally,
you need, to handle the priorities,

4
00:00:13.946 --> 00:00:18.954
